Third-party code ported into this project
=========================================

openScale
---------
Copyright (C) olie.xdev <olie.xdev@googlemail.com> and the openScale contributors.
License: GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later).
https://github.com/oliexdev/openScale

The Bluetooth scale protocols and the body-composition formulas were ported from openScale
(Java/Kotlin to Kotlin). GPL-3.0 section 13 allows combining this code with AGPL-3.0 code; the
combined work is distributed under the AGPL-3.0. Ported code lives in:

  - app/src/main/java/com/enjoyyourtime/globalfitness/scale/drivers/
      Scale drivers (every file whose header reads "ported from openScale").
  - app/src/main/java/com/enjoyyourtime/globalfitness/scale/libs/
      Scale protocol and body-composition libraries (AfuB1Lib, EtekcityLib, EufyP2Lib,
      ImpedanceLibs, KeepS3Lib, OmronLib, OneByoneLibs, RenphoEs26bbLib, S400,
      Wla07BodyComposition, Wla25BodyComposition). EtekcityLib reaches openScale from
      https://github.com/ronnnnnnnnnnnnn/etekcity_esf551_ble.
  - app/src/main/java/com/enjoyyourtime/globalfitness/domain/BodyMetrics.kt
      Mi Fit body-composition formulas, as in openScale's MiScaleLib.

Gadgetbridge
------------
Copyright (C) the Gadgetbridge contributors.
License: GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 or later (AGPL-3.0-or-later).
https://codeberg.org/Freeyourgadget/Gadgetbridge

The Xiaomi Smart Band protocol (SPP transport V1/V2, authentication, encryption and commands)
used by the experimental direct band mode was ported from Gadgetbridge. Ported code lives in:

  - app/src/main/java/com/enjoyyourtime/globalfitness/band/xiaomi/
  - app/src/main/proto/xiaomi.proto
      Trimmed copy of Gadgetbridge's xiaomi.proto message definitions.

